// Test-suite type-check configuration.
//
// Extends the package tsconfig so the specs stay under the same `strict`
// family as the library, with `noUncheckedIndexedAccess` relaxed. It is
// load-bearing for src/ — `validate()` walks a string character by character
// and would otherwise need a null-check on every read — and actively hostile
// to tests, which assert on a result array by position (`results[0].valid`) and
// on character-level input such as `results[0]` where the index being present
// is exactly the thing under test.
//
// The library keeps the guard (see ../tsconfig.json, which covers src/ and
// bench/). Only the test tree opts out, and only because its shape is
// genuinely dynamic.
{ "extends": "../tsconfig.json", "compilerOptions": { "noUncheckedIndexedAccess": false }, "include": ["./**/*.ts"] }
